 <section id="implementation">
   <div class="sec-label">CODE SPECIFICATION</div>
   <h2>Implementation</h2>
   <p class="lead">Four subsystems compose the DVE Pod. Each is independently testable and maps directly to the existing KNIRVSERVER DVE architecture.</p>

   <div class="code-tabs">
     <div class="tab-bar">
       <button class="tab-btn active" onclick="showTab('wasm')">WASM Core (Go)</button>
       <button class="tab-btn" onclick="showTab('bridge')">JS WASI Bridge</button>
       <button class="tab-btn" onclick="showTab('tee')">TEE &amp; Identity</button>
       <button class="tab-btn" onclick="showTab('storage')">Storage Layer</button>
       <button class="tab-btn" onclick="showTab('server')">Server-Side Hook</button>
